Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛格先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你肯定认识米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know Sheriff Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他的灵魂  他的灵魂不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将给你设一道屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put up a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要碰这个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认识我的  -路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am. - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是我最好的折磨手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is my best torture yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没跑出去过  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never left, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在囚笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still in the cage...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的皮囊正在融化  你马上就要爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vessel's melting. You're going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在炼狱中有着比那些灵魂更加古老的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things much older than souls in purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时也一并吞下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you gulped those in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-更古老的东西是什么  -利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What older things? - The leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我挡不住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't hold them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-挡住谁  -利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold who back? - Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  他消失啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is -- he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这将会非常非常有趣的啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is going to be so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有多少人在他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you ass-clowns are in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不止吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的皮囊要爆炸了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vessel's gonna explode, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要太操劳的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't do anything too strenuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换了我  就会收工回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'd call it a day, head on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会回来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前所未见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还觉得这个梦境是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this fruit bat Fever Dream is reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了  但是没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back -- I'm sorry -- with no soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像打了鸡血的美国精神病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}like some peppy "American Psycho,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到圣人迪恩买了点神奇的"忘情水"\N{\fnArial\fs30}till saint Dean glues you back together again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你又拼凑在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}by buying you some magic amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他所有一切都只是"布景"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything between is what we call "Set dressing."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -你还在我的牢笼中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You're still in my cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我们就住上下铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my bunkmate, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是我的小婊子  彻头彻尾的小婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my little bitch, in every sense of the term.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能听到我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hearin' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要了结此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got to button this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(请保护你的饮用水)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(为三郡区域供水)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(市水厂)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(公共水源)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些  不管是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those... whatever-you-call-'ems...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们进入了水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're in the pipes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像上了高速  四通八达\N{\fnArial\fs30}they got themselves a highway to anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算你们狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest in peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望如此吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that's in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还跟我们做朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was friends with us, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有比这更傻逼的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get much dumber than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西很快就会出来透气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things will be coming up for air soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(市保护区  不得入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(洗车  支持斯托克维尔球队)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  帅哥  醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点起床 伙计 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and at 'em, atom man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小萨姆  -小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy. - Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经睡了十二小时了  我觉得你休息够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 12 hours straight. I'm calling that rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你  补充水分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Hydrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  食用蛋白质\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, protein-ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在床上吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太习惯了  给我看看你手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get used to it. Let me see that hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  他要握你那小湿手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, he wants to hold your widdle hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太贴心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要渗透式入侵  有什么线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, ooze invasion -- any leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让我所有的眼线盯着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got all my feelers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论他们想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不会象摩斯拉那样大摇大摆地走上大街的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't -- it ain't about going Mothra down main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早会现身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们貌似十分渴望大展拳脚  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seemed pretty eager to stretch their legs, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  现在说说我们另一个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, now onto our other big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样  别用"不错"来忽悠哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing? And do not say "Okay."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么凶  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go a little easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  这事儿能松地了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing easy about it, bobby, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们装得像他能控制得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We acted like he had everything under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我也不想崩溃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I didn't exactly want to crack up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经不只是回忆的闪现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not just flashbacks anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从裂缝里看到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing through the cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  我现在已经难辨真假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I'm having a difficult time figuring out what's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幻觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallucinations?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你开始出现幻觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters, if you're trippin' hell's bells,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要隐瞒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would you hide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是隐瞒  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't hiding it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我只是不想说罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was just not talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩手头上的麻烦好像够多的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it seemed like you two had enough going on as it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我只是想自己想办法控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I just figured try to hold on to the safety bar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑下来算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ride it out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但幻觉却越来越具体真实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's getting more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,具体都有些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, specifically what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我勒个去  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还有什么可说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you -- how do you argue with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  确实有点严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I-it's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, wait. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个魔头能在牢笼里海扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the devil holodeck you a whole new life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛还要放你出来过新生活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he could just kick your ass all over the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  用他的话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, as he puts it... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能折磨一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't torture someone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经一无所有  没什么好失去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has nothing left for you to take away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得太好了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果这是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this Malibu dream Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他为了让你有所失而制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he -- he -- he makes for you to take away
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就造了这么个后天启时代乱世吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this post-apocalyptic mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆告诉他  必须得混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be a mess, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你会怀疑这不是你的人生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you wouldn't believe it was your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你不会现在也能看到他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you seeing him right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他不是真实存在的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that he's not real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也这么说你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says the same thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是回去做事好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科学家们还无法解释这种现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scientists have no explanation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能将其描述为一次"意外的月食"\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what astronomers can only describe as a "Surprise eclipse."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您很饥饿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干吗不来比格森自制馅饼吧来饱餐一顿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not indulge yourself at Biggerson's homemade pie bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是卖馅饼的沙拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a salad bar but with pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《性感医生》下集预告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next week on "Dr. Sexy, MD".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切耶尼·梅格诺普里斯医生震撼回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Cheyenne Meganopolis makes a shocking return...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了作为主治外科医生就意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot being head surgeon means
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以肆无忌惮地对任何人开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you cut into whatever body you want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随意切取你中意的器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take out whatever organ pleases you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不需要履行任何手续\N{\fnArial\fs30}without any paperwork whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  你的健忘真让我遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Doctor, I'm sorry you're so forgetful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(三城区治安官系统)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  至少他没蜷缩到水池底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least he's not curled up under the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没有  他就安安静静地坐那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, he's just sitting there silently,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,练习装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}field-stripping his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他的GPS打开  免得他又消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning on his GPS 'case he decides to fly the cuckoo's nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又不是中了巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't like he's hexed, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是治不好的疯病呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if this is the kind of crazy you can't fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我...我也很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm -- I'm worried, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但...就当哄哄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...humor me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.03,0:11:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还顾得上我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得我们现在手头的事够多的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think our mailbox is a little full right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:12:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And weren't you pissed at him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还没疯掉  也这么说的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he said the same thing just a couple hours before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也生他的气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}spilling his marbles all over the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是萨姆  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我头脑清醒的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep my marbles in a lead friggin' box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚失去了一个最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lost one of the best friends you ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟现在一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's in the bell jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼狱中最邪恶的家伙在下水管道里乱窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And purgatory's most wanted are surfin' the sewer lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  对  对  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}but yeah, yeah, I get it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're -- you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  如果你什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course...if at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你决定承认那都是屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to decide that's utter horse crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像以前一样  我会一直...\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I'll be where I always am --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这陪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想跟我做双人瑜伽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you want to do couples' yoga
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是想去收拾那些坏家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you want to get back to hunting the big bads?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  去你的吧  曼宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Up yours, Manning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是比你快0.06秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still got 0.06 on your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Where were you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们回来得早了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we got here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见浴室有奇怪的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard something weird coming from the showers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么啊  威廉姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing, Williams?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样会惹麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  斯考特  有可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Scott. I probably am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想威廉姆斯是想说  斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what Williams is trying to say, Scott,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们饿疯了  才不管这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that we're too hungry to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(苏福尔斯综合医院)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝急诊室的护士大喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crying to the E.R. nurse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"天啊  饶了我吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming, "Mother mary, mercy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们切开她的后背时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they opened her back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有三块海绵和一套夹具\N{\fnArial\fs30}three sponges and a set of clamps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缝在她身体里  活像个皮纳塔(一种装着糖果的装饰品)\N{\fnArial\fs30}sewn up inside like she was a living pinata!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不能信任这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't trust these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午好  女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  盖恩斯医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dr. Gaines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:14:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯小姐  你今天表现很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ms. Mills, you did excellent today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们说的  是一次标准的阑尾切除术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as we discussed, it was a textbook appendectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你刚经历了一系列的大手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have been through a serious surgical procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you're tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望你今晚别太勉强\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I want you to take it easy tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没问题  医生  -好消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Works for me, Doc. - The good news --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你开了些很好玩的止痛药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put you down for some pretty fun painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会先来看你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check in on you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就能回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be home in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很有风度  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming, isn't he? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知不知道有研究表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know a study showed 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四分之三的医生考试做过弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}3/4 of doctors cheat on their exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能都分不清你的阑尾和阴道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might not know your appendix from your vagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  小伙子  动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, Gunga Din. Buck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我们有些坏消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it looks like we got some bad news for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堪萨斯州北部  斯托克维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stockville, North Kansas,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一所高中的游泳队大部分成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of a high-school swim team
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在更衣室里被撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}got mangled to death in their locker room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.85,0:14:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察的说法含混其词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cop-talk on the wire's kind of garbled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说像是动物袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}sayin' it looks like some kind of wild-animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说攻击他们的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saying that whatever attacked them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有橄榄球中后卫那么壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}was about the size of a linebacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是条线索  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lead, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但如果你想参加这次捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but if you think you're going out on a hunt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我知道的  我不去  但你得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. I'm not, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  鲍比是信息中转站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby's running the hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在分不清现实和幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 5150'd,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只剩你去把这事搞明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which leaves you to follow this thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你现在处于精神崩溃状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you're in the middle of a psychotic break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时车程就到了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a couple hours' drive, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且可能是那利维坦怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it could be a Leviathan thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你以为我会把你一人留在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, if you think I'm leaving you here alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢  你当我不存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what am I, chopped brains on toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着这孩子  你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can eyeball the kid. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的心思放到有用的活上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work off some of these nerves on something useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这躯壳可真瘦小\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got yourself an awfully small body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既瘦小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又无知\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连柜台都够不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even see over the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧我这副...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Edgar"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加是爆破小组的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar worked on something called a demolitions crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到东西被炸飞  他显然有种满足感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching things blow up is apparently very satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"安妮"知道婴儿从何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Annie" knew where babies come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说  这很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  说起这个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们活吞了游泳队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ate the swim team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所言  饥饿难耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said -- hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.45,0:16:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们老实点  我不管你用什么手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them in line. I don't care how.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  都上新闻头条了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For god's sake, it made the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  老大  其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the boss, honestly --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只想知道这事处理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just wants to hear it's taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就赶紧把事办好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take care of it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢向他汇报坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like bringing him bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘  有什么需要帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是性感医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a Dr. Sexy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...I'm a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸妈妈在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外科医生可以肆无忌惮地对任何人开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgeons can just cut into whatever body they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随意切取他们中意的器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remove whichever organs they please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟是从哪听来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where in the world did you hear --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我长大后要当一名外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a surgeon when I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我现在就要长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to grow up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.25,0:17:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我是伊恩·安德森特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Special Agent Anderson, Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们驻点的警员出去买面包圈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our point cop's out on the doughnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是法医  可以带你看下现场  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Forensics. I can show you the layout. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请小心行走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And step lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边有一大堆限制级的恶心东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a whole bunch of NC-17 shizznickle right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别出声  深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Just breathe deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我的手术定在明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my surgery isn't till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是性感医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手术我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your surgery is when I say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太不奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not weird at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以确定是那帮恶心的家伙干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are positive for ick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和小卡身上流出来的玩意儿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same kind of stuff that came out of Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且游泳队有两个小孩依然下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, two of the swim kids are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们偷了家里的一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stole one of their parents' cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的觉得威廉王子找对了姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really think Prince William has found the right girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you think these, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦也像夏娃一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan things just jump into people,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会附身于人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Eve did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  这说得通啊  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It makes sense, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  州警的监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, uh, state troopers got surveillance cam 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概六小时前发现了那俩小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the kids, about six hours old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们加油后朝达科他州边界的南部行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gassing up just south of the Dakota line,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在回你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm headed back your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再从鲍比家出发去追他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just track 'em from Bobby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你状态如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  坚持住  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, hang in there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是还行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  我可是状态极佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm having a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(病房停用待修)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯小姐  你下床做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Mills, what are you doing out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯小姐  你把我们吓了一大跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Mills, you gave us all a scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在的病情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be wandering
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以那样四处走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the halls like that in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.57,0:21:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把  他把\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took -- he took...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖恩斯医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gaines?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯小姐  我们嘱咐过你别太勉强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Mills, we told you to take it easy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那么四处走动是做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world were you doing wandering the halls like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缝合处有点儿痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, my stitches were itching,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问问这是不是正常现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just wanted to know if that was normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定是昏倒了什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I must have fainted or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的伤口现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stitches feel fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯小姐你不能下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Mills, you can't get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那样的摔倒可能会撕裂缝合口呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have ripped open your sutures with a fall like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别让我再给你开刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me go back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.19,0:22:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.99,0:22:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是帮助你睡眠的药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just something to help you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.65,0:22:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不用  我会睡得好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's okay. I'll sleep just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我过会儿再来看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check on you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  魔鬼医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kiss my ass, Dr. Monsterface.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:22:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.97,0:23:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这只是你可以任意掌控的梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if this is some dream and you got power over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you just end it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}End it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在分不清孰真孰假\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- you not knowing what's real,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神智一点点走向崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}the paint slowly peeling off your walls --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想一想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是最有趣的时候  怎么可以结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the sweet spot. Why would I end it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱又没有线电视看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we got HBO in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有你一个玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I got is you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.47,0:23:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你在混乱中挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}floating over the coals
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在绝望边缘寻找出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}with half a hope that you're gonna figure it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一条出路  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to figure it out, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全由你掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再也无法承受的时候  就会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends when you can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你擦枪或许就是做这个用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe that's why we're cleaning our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有点小慌乱了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Havin' a little bag-lady moment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:23:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.71,0:24:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, after...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.95,0:24:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年  什么艰难险阻都见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all these years, all that we've been through...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前战胜过他  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beat the devil before, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.71,0:24:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你同样会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get a handle on this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.36,0:24:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不在地狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in hell anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里  和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here, with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.43,0:24:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听明白了吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:24:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.57,0:25:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That's my local.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.85,0:25:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.82,0:25:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·辛格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.64,0:25:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的医生是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My surgeon is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.78,0:25:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.47,0:25:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带走了我的话痨室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my windbag roomie,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.16,0:25:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃了她的肝脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he ate her liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本就不是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except he wasn't -- he wasn't a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.78,0:25:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.84,0:25:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  他的脸...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen! His face was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.67,0:25:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的嘴是个可怕的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mouth was this horrible th--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.71,0:25:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是谁  -乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - It's jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.23,0:25:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔迪·米尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没法叫支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't exactly call a deputy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.47,0:25:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装了  我们一起杀过僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you and I killed zombies that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.96,0:25:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你能处理这档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you handle this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.89,0:25:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你在他把我吃掉之前赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get your ass here to Sioux Falls general
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.41,0:25:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏福尔斯综合医院  辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he eats me, Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.21,0:25:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果米尔斯警长不是做恶梦梦见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, either sheriff Mills is having
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥巴马医改方案成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Obamacare-insured opium dream
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是苏福尔斯综合医院出了食人案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or something's eating folks down at sioux falls general hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.31,0:26:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤你自尊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want to bruise your ego or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's -- it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧  我来负责接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go. I-I'll watch the phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.49,0:26:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下我们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just you and me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.30,0:26:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(苏福尔斯综合医院)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.46,0:26:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.22,0:26:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.07,0:26:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖恩斯医生在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Dr. Gaines?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.18,0:26:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看病要走程序  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, that's not how it works, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想找医师看病\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you require a physician's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先把这两份表填了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to fill out these forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.33,0:26:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧  护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take over from here, nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}These...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.25,0:26:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子需要马上接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}youths obviously require immediate care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.11,0:26:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是人类修复自己身体的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where they bring their bodies to be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.72,0:26:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们认为这儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They consider it a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  这里经常有人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is, often they actually die here instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.21,0:26:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且没人会起疑心  没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they never question it. I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.47,0:27:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们偷偷的进食  没人会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can feed discreetly. No one will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.14,0:27:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们在适当位置安插好人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of us in the right positions,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都将是饕餮盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we could feast every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想就从护士长和人事科长开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking head nurse and the staff administrator for a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.31,0:27:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实有一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to hand it to you --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.53,0:27:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是老大要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly what the boss asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.76,0:27:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我的发散思维  -不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out-of-the-box thinking. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用再当游泳队员了  孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off the swim team, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候弃文从医了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to pursue a career in medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先这样  跟我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.65,0:27:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不留下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.16,0:27:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常乐意为你抓个麻醉医师来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would love to grab us a good anesthesiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还有另外的事情要我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to check into some other business in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.74,0:27:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况  你做的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, seems you've got things well in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.70,0:27:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们不叫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't they scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.21,0:27:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我事先切断了他们的声带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I severed their vocal cords, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是个精细的活儿  多亏我技术好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a delicate procedure but very doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.19,0:28:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.30,0:28:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟踪了那些游泳队员  利维...什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed those swim-kid Levia...Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.42,0:28:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到哪儿  -这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To where? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.99,0:28:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们回城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.21,0:28:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that ain't the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们可不止两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't just two of them, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给鲍比打过电话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.16,0:28:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打了  他有事在忙  我得行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's working his own case, I got to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.65,0:28:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要支援  也就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need backup, and that means you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.02,0:28:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你确定要用我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You -- you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.97,0:28:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你脑抽着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. You're bonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还好  我只要你开着车别熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, luckily, I just need you to keep the engine running
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.73,0:28:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在后门等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait by the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.83,0:28:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.71,0:28:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让你家撒旦乱改我设的车台就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let satan change my presets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.48,0:28:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(西北入口)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫哈克特夫人  她再也没能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Mrs. Hackett. She never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.17,0:29:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.48,0:29:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回去好好休息  我回头去看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get some rest. I'll come by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.03,0:29:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·辛格  我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer, my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.35,0:29:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是打了麻药昏了头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the roofies talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(停尸间)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.18,0:29:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足部手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foot surgery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.11,0:29:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已解剖了  搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already autopsied? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  萨姆  我指脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Sam? In the head region?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.47,0:29:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼还在骚扰你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil still riding shotgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.27,0:29:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没  可是经常有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now, but...Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.26,0:29:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们该带你去看看  那什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we ought to get you, I don't know, some --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:30:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么  找白衣天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some what? Some "Professional help"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.29,0:30:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能怎样  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they gonna do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会给我塞一把药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stuff me full of pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得另想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure out some other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.06,0:30:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你还有什么办法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are your other options?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.65,0:30:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得马丁发疯的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember when Martin took his nosedive
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.68,0:30:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举枪对着空气乱打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started shooting at nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.09,0:30:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没过多久就把自己折腾死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, his sweater unraveled fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不是马丁  -没错  可是你也疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not Martin. - No, but you are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.21,0:30:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会就那么好起来  你很清楚  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that don't wash off. You get that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不可能好起来的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are never gonna be okay, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.33,0:31:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.16,0:31:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  他们有五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it. There's five of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.49,0:31:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.14,0:31:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.04,0:31:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  听好了  当我们进去后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and listen, when we get in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.88,0:31:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可得振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.32,0:31:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I-I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.30,0:31:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能看到路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if you're seeing Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.36,0:31:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就有可能看到各种乱七八糟的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you could be seeing all kinds of crap, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.01,0:31:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想都想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.45,0:31:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是帮倒忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  萨姆  你已经失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, Sam, you're out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.39,0:31:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在尽我所能处理这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing with it the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.86,0:31:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.49,0:31:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  那实在太搞笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. That's just funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how can you deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这是栋办公楼  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is an office building, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这是在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.18,0:32:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.73,0:32:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.83,0:32:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个可怜又无知的狗崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poor clueless son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the hell away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的世界由我主宰  明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world is whatever I want it to be, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.55,0:32:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你已经开始懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,匹诺曹看到牵着他的绳子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinocchio's seeing his strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.45,0:32:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.30,0:32:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮部分来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the big crescendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.12,0:32:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.73,0:32:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想把枪指着你能杀得了的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to point that gun at someone useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.13,0:32:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试你自己的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道真相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.28,0:32:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想直接看到这事的结局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to skip to the last page of the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该把枪瞄准哪里  牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where to aim, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.47,0:32:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就像个恶心的打包袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a friggin' doggy bag in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.23,0:32:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么需要帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不如帮帮这家医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can maybe still help this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份马马虎虎的文件是谁写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's responsible for this sloppy bit of documentation?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.74,0:33:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.74,0:33:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你认错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.73,0:33:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛格  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singer. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.17,0:33:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们通过那个天使的双眼  看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw you -- through the angel's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.88,0:33:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你得试试失忆症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try for amnesia, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.55,0:33:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.87,0:34:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  又一个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look. Another me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.37,0:34:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我以为我跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was with you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.57,0:34:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.57,0:34:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我  我不  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I-I don't -- I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.49,0:34:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't know that for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.90,0:34:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就得一点点慢慢来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then we're gonna have to start small.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.46,0:34:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得我开车到这里来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember driving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.97,0:34:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为开车的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's because I drove.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.94,0:34:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.58,0:34:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆耳根子真软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is very suggestible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.00,0:34:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.53,0:34:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的谈话不需要开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This discussion does not require a weapons discharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.10,0:34:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.68,0:34:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.99,0:34:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道什么是真实的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.79,0:35:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去过地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I've been to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.45,0:35:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于折磨我略知一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I know a thing or two about torture --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以知道地狱的感觉不同于\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough to know that it feels different
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.88,0:35:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个乱七八糟的东西带给你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the pain of this -- this regular stupid crappy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.91,0:35:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  你怎么能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, how can you know that for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.65,0:35:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  那  那只受伤的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. The -- the gimp hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.98,0:35:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开  弗洛伦斯·南丁格尔(护士)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell you, Florence Nightingale.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.30,0:35:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.83,0:35:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并非一年前  并非在地狱  而是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a year ago, not in hell -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.15,0:35:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤的时候我跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with you when you cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.40,0:35:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你缝的针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sewed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.93,0:35:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.99,0:35:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在疼痛方面做了许多改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done a lot more with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.54,0:35:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉是不同的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different -- right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.28,0:35:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟要把你逼疯的东西是不同的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than the crap that's tearing at your walnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.16,0:35:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是不同的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm different. Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:35:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.77,0:35:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗  铺友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that, bunk buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.91,0:35:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.33,0:36:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.15,0:36:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的亲哥哥  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your flesh-and-blood brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是唯一一个可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the only one who
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名正言顺的立马揍你一顿的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}can legitimately kick your ass in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.66,0:36:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.68,0:36:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把你弄出来了  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you out, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.41,0:36:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.57,0:36:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  我是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I'm the only one who can --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.21,0:36:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.32,0:36:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.10,0:36:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把它当做第一准则并凡事以它为基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to make it stone number one and build on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.80,0:36:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.16,0:36:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的  同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. Agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.78,0:36:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警官是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.15,0:36:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医院的事绝对是我们职权范围内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hospital thing's definitely our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在太平间冲他们一个人开了"双筒炮"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I double-barreled one of them in the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.15,0:36:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用银子弹打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver buck shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.72,0:36:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.17,0:36:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只流出一些黑色的液体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bled black ooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.14,0:37:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-利维坦在那吗  -我逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leviathan here? - I'm fallin' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在我家见面吧  我们重新部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the house. We can regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比见到了个活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's got a live one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.28,0:37:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们重新回到鲍比家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when we get back to Bobby's...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.48,0:37:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  迪恩  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Dean. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.36,0:37:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见白兔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No white rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.06,0:37:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not seeing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.78,0:37:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.21,0:37:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.74,0:37:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.17,0:37:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(禁止入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.41,0:38:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方被火烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place was torched.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.04,0:38:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干这事的人目的明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody knew what they were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.35,0:38:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得鲍当时在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Bobby was back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.70,0:38:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.29,0:38:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.27,0:38:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是鲍比·辛格直通热线\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bobby Singer's direct hot line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.06,0:38:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该有这号码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not have this number.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.77,0:38:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会在那个火坑里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot be in that crater back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能  如果你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't -- if you're gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.44,0:38:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓会把我那心灵美丽的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I am going to strap my "beautiful mind" brother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绑到车上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.46,0:38:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,载着我们开车驶下码头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna drive us off the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.66,0:38:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问我过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me how I was doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.99,0:39:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.18,0:39:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过你会陪着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you said you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.77,0:39:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.66,0:39:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.31,0:39:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.75,0:39:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.02,0:39:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.12,0:39:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.93,0:39:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来  你们两兄弟有足够的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you two are competent enough
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.93,0:39:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能消灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to warrant annihilating.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.65,0:39:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是恭维你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.56,0:40:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.59,0:40:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.20,0:40:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  醒醒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?! Hey, come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.63,0:40:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒  我腿骨折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'm the one with the broken leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.78,0:40:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得背我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.46,0:40:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.98,0:40:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别离开我  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay with me, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.16,0:40:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男性 不到三十岁 颅脑损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male, late 20s, head trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.98,0:40:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,颅内压有不断增加的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signs of increasing intracranial pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.20,0:40:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so maybe I'm not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.21,0:40:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人无完人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我哪里也不去  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not going anywhere, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.18,0:41:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.70,0:41:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他癫痫发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's seizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.01,0:41:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他注射十毫升镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him 10 of valium.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.19,0:41:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到  我们刚开进苏福尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. We're just pulling in to Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.79,0:41:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏福尔斯吗  苏福尔斯综合医院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sioux Falls? Sioux Falls General?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.66,0:41:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你得带我们去别的地方  任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you got to take us somewhere else. Anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.75,0:41:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.15,0:41:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
